+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T21:39:00Z
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Authenticated POST/PUT cart requests now associate and authorize carts for the principal’s customer. Customer cart lookup, totals, checkout validation, and order pagination now preserve the required customer isolation and HTTP semantics.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartApi.java` | modified | Routes authenticated cart creation and modification through customer-aware methods. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacade.java` | modified | Adds customer-scoped cart modification contract. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/controller/shoppingCart/facade/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Rejects modification of carts not owned by the customer. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/facade/shoppingCart/ShoppingCartFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Explicit cart lookup is customer-scoped. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/shoppingcart/ShoppingCartServiceImpl.java` | modified | Selects the newest open customer cart using audit timestamps and id fallback. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderTotalApi.java` | modified | Preserves cart/customer 404 responses instead of converting them to 503. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/order/OrderApi.java` | modified | Enforces checkout ownership and returns 400 for calculated payment mismatches. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/repositories/order/OrderRepositoryImpl.java` | modified | Computes ceiling-based total pages for customer-filtered order lists. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No dedicated API tests were present or added; the affected modules were compile-checked.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `./mvnw -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests compile` → passed after correcting the added `java.util.Date` import.
+- Manual checks: reviewed the resulting diff for customer ownership checks, 404 preservation, payment mismatch handling, newest-cart selection, and descending order query.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The assessment proposed dedicated endpoint tests, but this repository did not expose a ready test fixture for the authenticated API/database flow; no new test fixture was introduced.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add integration tests with two authenticated customers and seeded tax/order data when the application test fixture is available.
